n- **#8841** appears three times in three different descriptions: the Allentown kiosk timeout on Jul 1 and May 4, and the Newark Door 14 kiosk on Sep 30. Either the number was reused or the digests have mixed up sites. The Apr 27 digest puts Allentown gate check-ins under PD-8841, which is a separate number.\n- The Sep 15 digest's PD-4418 is attributed to \"the account Nadia runs\" without naming Vantorre, as noted above.\n\n**Left out**\n\n- PD-4402 (Sep 15 digest) is Quillfeather Outfitters, not Vantorre.\n- Vantorre Mobility items, including Moss's Dec 1 2025 digest, are excluded per your request.\n- The Aug 3 2026 digest describes the Hartford incident but gives no ticket number."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000127"}}
